  "bodyHash": "1ec4e37cdda6d63f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/401955/description_6f6e55e4-d1c2-4e5c-8eee-356da3fda062.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Ars Nouveau 是一款受 Ars Magicka 啟發的魔法模組，讓玩家能夠自製法術、創造魔法道具、執行儀式等。所有文件皆由 Patchouli 完整提供於遊戲內。要開始遊玩此模組，請使用一本書和 1 個青金石製作「破舊筆記本」。您也可以參考下方的維基。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.arsnouveau.wiki%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://www.arsnouveau.wiki/</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>引入自訂法術製作系統——隨心所欲打造符合需求的法術！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>打造強力的新飾品與寶物。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>為魔法機器供能。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>讓可愛的魔法僕從幫你自動化基地運作！</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\"><strong>正在尋找整合包？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>試試看 Arcane Isles！一款結合 Ars Nouveau 與 Hex Casting 的空島整合包。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入社群！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入 Discord 獲取幫助並與其他法師交流！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu</strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/743298050222587978/widget.png?style=banner2\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\"></a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">支持本模組</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>若要支持本模組，歡迎前往我們的 Redbubble 商店選購 Ars Nouveau 周邊商品！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.redbubble.com%252fpeople%252fGootastic%252fshop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://www.redbubble.com/people/Gootastic/shop</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>您還可以透過 Patreon 支持我們！Patreon 贊助等級包含 Discord 專屬認可角色，以及提交您對新施法者法典（可於地牢戰利品中獲得）的創意構想！在訂閱期間還有機會獲得周邊商品！Patreon 成員亦將獲得進入 Discord 私服的權限。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>依賴項目</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Curios</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 3.0（適用於 Minecraft 1.16.0 及以上版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 2.0（適用於 1.15 之後至 1.16.0 之前的任何 Minecraft 版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Terrablender（選填依賴項，用於在 Minecraft 1.19+ 中啟用 Archwood Forest 生態域）</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>法術製作</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>即時製作屬於你的法術！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lgQ3x4-FWFw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>儀式</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>施放強大的持續性區域法術！</strong></span><br><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IG-lTfAPVCQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>魔法助手</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>召喚各種魔法生物協助自動化運作！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z1IT__CtCQs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>製作與附魔物品</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>打造強力物品或為你的裝備附魔！<br></strong></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rcnhISDnlZ8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>特色展示與實況錄影</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EPlrqmtnTuk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">正在尋找擴充模組？</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Creo（由 Ars Nouveau 團隊開發）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">為法術砲塔、源質罐等加入 Create 模組相容性！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Too Many Glyphs（作者：DerringerCubed）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增多種符號，包含篩選器、特殊形態及獨特的目標鎖定/法術操控符號。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars EnderStorage（作者：MoonWolf）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">架設 Ars Nouveau 與 EnderStorage 之間的橋樑，允許你從任何地方存取終界儲存空間、將方塊破壞並存入箱子，並顯示數值化的法力值。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Elemental（作者：Alexthw）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">為氣、土、火、水四大學派新增 4 種法術焦點，以及一種腐化版的召喚焦點，能讓召喚出的生物變得更加詭異。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Scalaes（作者：Alexthw）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增多項跨模組相容功能，包括 Pekhui、ProjectMMO 與 Scaling Health。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Arsenal（作者：ToxicMintTea）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">擴展防具選項，包含元素師法袍與板甲，提供折扣、增幅及獨特的隱藏增益效果。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Tome of Blood（作者：ToxicMintTea）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">與 Ars Nouveau 和 Blood Magic 進行整合，提供特殊符號及消耗 LP 的物品與法術！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Instrumentum（作者：Sarenor）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">提供多種生活便利物品與配方，用於儲存/黏貼星靈、中繼器、更換裝甲等！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Omega（作者：dkmk100_ludum_dare）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">大幅擴展 Ars Nouveau 的力量上限，新增強力符號、方塊、儀式、次元等內容。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega</span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Zettai Ars（作者：ZettaSword）-</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">一款跨界整合模組，將 Ars Nouveau、Mana and Artifice 與 PlayerEx 完美融合！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars</span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KqNBPc.mp4\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>正在尋找其他模組？</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>來看看 BlockPrints！這是一個藍圖分享與下載平台：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints</a></span></strong></span></p>",
